# Perf kill-list, overriding PERF_UNITS in tv-root-apply (read at start of each apply).
# Edit this file to bisect; empty/comments = mask nothing.
#
# aaa_tvs_deamon is deliberately NOT here: masking it breaks Prime Video playback
# on this set (found by boot bisect 2026-10-31; the app opens and reports
# "Something went wrong. Please try again later" for every video).
swu-auto-upgrade
reporterCA
emergency-log-transmitter
pvod-appfw.pvodservice
wireless-cam-service
wifi-presence
mirroring-recognition-manager
ambient-ua-agent
pisa-service
nagsam-daemon
ua-manager
